{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9e0641c055c243c5092446867b0fce4b6f2fe216aec80f63275a492ef0e27a16", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\nそろそろ莉緒の着替えも終わる頃かな）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的日子。\n莉绪差不多该换好衣服了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "f1b8d1d8693699a26375f8f12a2fdece3d0421aeeb7a88c8245b62c425db2ae3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしましたっ♪\n今日はよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让你久等啦♪\n今天就拜托你啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f0855895335879a52263217f54bee4fdab5daf2ed4ff1092454768c784598b6e", "ja": "えっ？　莉緒……？", "zh": "咦？莉绪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "f47455323f3f6301b64ddf99c176d2fde6121cc89ebf525bcc3f3adc1ac862a4", "ja": "ウフフ、驚いた♪　素敵な衣装だから、\nちょっと雰囲気に寄せてみようかなって思って。", "zh": "嘻嘻，吓到了吧♪ 因为这身服装很漂亮，所以我想着稍微配合一下它的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b2aed4ce6b2302c6891cbfb3600ad380a981ed089f69d97eea73338cdab4baeb", "ja": "それで、さっきの挨拶か。\nたしかに、衣装とも合っててすごく良かったよ。", "zh": "所以，刚才才会那样打招呼啊。\n确实和服装很搭，感觉特别棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "7816dcacd8925fe17cb264a9b651156a146162107d11cc797dca1720ea14aaac", "ja": "そうでしょ♪　私もまだまだいけるなって……。\nあっ。ははーん……私、わかっちゃった。", "zh": "对吧♪ 我也觉得自己还大有可为呢……啊。哈——我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "5d0086fe400ef4cce6b9a41d3d9139fe5c186a1de4210370270d2559efb7c65a", "ja": "さては{$P$}くん……。\nこういう可愛らしい感じの女の子が好みなのね！", "zh": "我说啊，{$P$}君……  \n你喜欢这种可爱类型的女孩子，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "83a37fcd07abc5f436a9ff86bb3fb1d55c0ae895840fed28dab193c020cb144f", "ja": "ウフフ、図星ね♪\nもう……それなら最初から言ってくれればいいのに。", "zh": "哎呀，被我说中了吧♪\n真是的……既然这样，一开始就告诉我不就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2c09c56724038ecc8a12cb25cecc280a969c7428e2fa0b3caa6f2af24bf483ed", "ja": "いや、まだ何も言ってないけど……。", "zh": "不，我还什么都没说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "577a014074254a3fe0aa52fc547a773a337b6730de83ede0e9ee68da0f6c0481", "ja": "キミが振り向いてくれるなら……\n私、どんな女の子にもなれるのよ？", "zh": "只要你愿意回头看我……\n我可是能变成任何类型的女孩子哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "0a90b466705d181666b0aec8217f921f20a1fa17970ff084387384a5378c6a6a", "ja": "そうね。可愛らしい感じならメイクも……。\nあら？　{$P$}くん、どうしたの？", "zh": "没错。要是走可爱风，妆容也可以……  \n咦？{$P$}，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fee65f2d740133fdd8b3b4839c1e79d96354a2671a48f8caa055a8d9ca57ef4c", "ja": "あ、ああ……。今日はイイ写真が撮れそうだと思って。\n莉緒の可愛いところ、たくさん撮ってもらおう！", "zh": "啊，嗯……我觉得今天应该能拍到很棒的照片。\n让大家多拍一些莉绪可爱的样子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "340b72f492cba2c26cbdf53ef607b132b6f3c17ee9be224460f4d10c0725ca7a", "ja": "へっ？　かわいい……？\n私、まだ何もしてないけど……。", "zh": "诶？可爱……？\n我还什么都没做呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4184539d973d580fd538953503fa024f3e0d138e532f36f523d89c5576e1b8c4", "ja": "ん？　何もしなくていいんじゃないか？\nそのままでも可愛いと思うし。", "zh": "嗯？不用做什么吧？\n我觉得你这样就很可爱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "1e5b6237ae2ce6cc3497d3da33af666d828338819c998d82f19d8c9814ae440f", "ja": "え？　え？　な、なんで……急に……。\nうう～……私、ちょっとメイク直してくるわね～！", "zh": "诶？诶？为、为什么……突然……  \n呜呜～……我去补一下妆哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0363_1017_p", "source_sha256": "75c0ee5902cce87593aa7654d1518ba03d835ce11e756c20231c00e9558ab0b3", "ja": "莉緒！？　もうすぐ本番……おーい！", "zh": "莉绪！？马上就要正式演出了……喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
